 way imaginable and there  are concerns that that is really going  to fracture that critical oversight  bipartisan relationship now in talking  to rank-and-file they say they are still  100% focused on their job they're not  paying attention to what's going on here  in Washington but there are some  concerns  that the general public may start to  lose trust in the FBI Gail thank you  very much Paula
 

